{{High Risk|Template:Font color|nocat=1|pagetype=Main}}
Colors inline text, optionally over a background color. Any valid CSS color works (named colors, <code>#rgb</code>/<code>#rrggbb</code>, <code>rgb()</code>). Supports <code>safesubst:</code>.

==Syntax==
Two forms, depending on whether a background color is supplied:
{{T|Font color|block=1
|v1=text-color
|v2=text
}}
{{T|Font color|block=1
|v1=text-color
|v2=background-color
|v3=text
}}

==Examples==
* {{T|Font color|_Y_=1|p1=red|p2=Sekihan}}
* {{T|Font color|_Y_=1|p1=white|p2=#3a7bd5|p3=Soraru}}

